## Health Probes

### Liveness Probe

Checks:

> **Is the application alive?**

If it repeatedly fails, Kubernetes can restart the container.

### Readiness Probe

Checks:

> **Is the application ready to receive traffic?**

If it fails, the Pod is removed from Service endpoints.

